Package: robopi-addon
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kmod, roboparty-base (>= 1.0.0),
         network-manager, iw, eject, udev, util-linux, python3, python3-serial, python3-usb, python3-crcmod, python3-hid
Replaces: roboparty-ws2812 (<< 1.5.0), roboparty-base (<= 1.1.2-1)
Breaks: roboparty-ws2812 (<< 1.5.0)
Description: RoboPi RK3588S WS2812 and SIG/key GPIO helpers
 Controls a 12-pixel WS2812B-MINI-V3/W strip from PWM6_M1 on the RoboParty RK3588S
 board through a kernel PWM transmitter. Also provides SIG-controlled LED output and gated key handling for
 GPIO3_B1, GPIO3_B6, and GPIO3_B4.
